<div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size:12pt">Dear Franki Allegra,</span=
></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I hope this message finds you well. My name is Robert Sam=
uel White (Sam), and I was recently encouraged to apply for a volunteer hos=
t position within Oregon State Parks by Matt, a host at Cape Blanco, and Je=
rry, a park ranger I=92ve come to know
 at both Cape Blanco and Humbug Mountain State Parks. Both have spoken posi=
tively about my time here and expressed their willingness to vouch for me a=
s a strong candidate.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Over the past two months, I=92ve been living and engaging=
 deeply with the southern Oregon coast, where I feel a profound sense of be=
longing. After a month-long journey from Kentucky, I arrived here and knew =
almost immediately I was =93home.=94 I=92ve
 been exploring this landscape=97its lighthouses, rugged beaches, and trail=
s=97with reverence and a strong desire to contribute meaningfully to its pr=
eservation and maintenance. I=92m committed to staying along the 101 for th=
e long term and would be honored to support
 Oregon=92s State Parks through volunteer service.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">The Yurt/Cabin Host position at Umpqua Lighthouse State P=
ark aligns perfectly with my skills, strengths, and current way of life. I =
am deeply organized, hardworking, and accustomed to the physical tasks requ=
ired, such as cleaning, light landscaping,
 and general maintenance. I also value providing excellent visitor experien=
ces and creating welcoming, well-kept spaces for all who come to enjoy thes=
e parks. I am fully capable of meeting the role=92s requirements and bring =
with me not only practical skills
 but a personal connection to the parks I would serve.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">If you have time for a conversation, I=92d greatly apprec=
iate the opportunity to discuss this position and learn more about the expe=
ctations and application process. I currently have limited internet access =
while camped at Humbug Mountain, but
 I can find connectivity for any necessary next steps.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward=
 to the possibility of contributing to the incredible work being done acros=
s Oregon State Parks. Please feel free to reach out via email or phone at y=
our earliest convenience.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Warm regards,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Robert Samuel White</div>
